  "problem": "Alice has three email accounts. \nIn the first account, she received $16$ emails, of which $5$ were spam. \nIn the second account, she received $10$ emails, of which $2$ were spam. \nAnd in the third account, she received $14$ emails, of which $3$ were spam. \nBased on this data, what is the probability that a randomly selected email across all her accounts is spam?",
